    "title": "Kanye West's brand hit with damaging lawsuit - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dorcas Onasa ,\n1 hours ago Kanye West’s Yeezy brand is facing yet another legal challenge, this time from a web design company claiming it was never compensated for work it completed nearly a year ago. Ryanso, LLC filed the lawsuit after what it describes as repeated attempts to collect payment went unanswered adding another difficult chapter to what has been a turbulent stretch for the brand and its founder. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
